<title>JAPAN: Japan June chain store sales fall 5.1% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan June chain store sales fall 5.1% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at chain stores in Japan in June declined 5.1 percent from a year earlier to 1.33 trillion yen, the Japan Chain Stores Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, chain store sales fell 1.3 percent in June, the association said in a statement.</p>
<p>Chain store sales in the January-June period decreased 0.9 percent year-on-year to 8.18 trillion yen, the statement said.</p>
</text>
